  "notes": "Cash-basis governmental funds (Total Governmental Funds column p4) with accrual business-type funds (Water, Sewer, Garbage; Total column pp5-8). Governmental roll-forward: 1,790,159 + 987,503 - 1,598,490 + debt proceeds 710,000 + sale of assets 84,997 = 1,974,169. Business-type: 966,209 + 380,900 - 373,899 = 973,210; disbursements total = operating 361,543 + interest 12,356, printed as Total Business-type Activities expenses on p2 (water/sewer expense totals including interest likewise from p2). Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position, Total column (p1), since it includes business-type capital assets and debt. The only supplementary schedule is the combined all-funds budget and actual schedule (p9, includes utility funds on a budgetary basis), so detail is per fund column of the governmental funds (p4) and proprietary funds (p6) statements; p9 not recorded. Read pages 1-9 of 9"
}
